
<h2>The CIT website is currently unavailable due to system maintenance.</h2>
                        <h3>We're sorry for the inconvenience.</h3>
                        <p>
                          If you're a CIT Bank customer, you can directly sign in to your account 24 hours a day at <a href="https://login-secure.digital.citbank.com/idp/B447/?ClientID=CIT-PROD-CNSMR">CIT Bank Online Banking</a> or through the mobile app.
                        </p>
                        <p>For assistance:</p>
                        <ul>
                          <li>
                            Once you are signed into online banking, you can send us a secure message. Go to <b>Communications>Secure message</b> to get started.
                          </li>
                          <li>
                            Call our Customer Engagement Center at <a href="tel:8554622652">855-462-2652</a> to speak with a CIT Bank representative Monday through Friday: 9 a.m. to 9 p.m. ET,<br>Saturdays: 10 a.m. to 6 p.m. ET. We are closed Sundays and holidays.
                          </li>
                        </ul>
                        <p>
                          To open an account, please visit: <a href="https://citbankapp.cit.com/">https://citbankapp.cit.com/</a>
                        </p>
